  "question": {
    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/jhV-H2VCngyjwaVe4ZFJpgGyop3goHsGEjpcG34Tpc8.original.fullsize.png\"/>\nA block is simply released from the top of an inclined plane as shown in the figure above. The maximum compression in the spring when the block hits the spring is :",
